    "规则": {
      "status": "CATALOG_REPORTED_UNVERIFIED",
      "value": "信号（Signal Browser Definition）：Number if consecutive 4-quarter increases in ibq, up to 8. 组合规则（该页字段）：StockWeight=EW；LSQuantile=0.2；PortfolioPeriod=1.0个月；StartMonth=12.0；Sign=1.0；TestInOP=port sort FF3 alpha。股票池/过滤：abs(prc)>5。 Notes：This signal isn't exactly found in Loh and Warachka, but table 4 suggests that this would predict returns. GHZ have this signal and cite Barth, Elliott and Finn 1999, but Barth et al do not study predictability according to Loh and Warachka. I (Andrew) couldn't locate Barth et al online during the pandemic, but the abstract of Barth et al is consistent with Loh and Warachka's interpretation.。 基线为原论文分组的多空组合（FAQ：baseline follows the original paper split；数据页写 monthly long-short following OPs）。未在该行写出的细节不补。"
